%% Selected single-server AWS demonstration; optional EKS/RDS diagram is under advanced/.
flowchart LR
    Visitor --> VisitorSite[Visitor website on Amplify]
    Admin --> AdminSite[Admin website on Amplify]
    VisitorSite --> Cognito
    AdminSite --> Cognito
    VisitorSite --> Gateway[API Gateway]
    AdminSite --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Proxy[HTTPS NGINX origin proxy]
    subgraph Server[One EC2 server / Minikube]
        Proxy --> Ingress[Minikube Ingress]
        Ingress --> Catalog[Attractions API]
        Ingress --> Booking[Booking API]
        Ingress --> Gate[Gate and rides API]
        Ingress --> Analytics[Analytics API and worker]
        Catalog --> PostgreSQL[PostgreSQL schemas and outboxes]
        Booking --> PostgreSQL
        Gate --> PostgreSQL
        Analytics --> PostgreSQL
        Metabase -->|read-only views| PostgreSQL
    end
    Analytics <--> SQS
    Server --> CloudWatch
    ECR --> Server
    S3[Private source artifacts] --> Server
    Operator[Operator via private SSM tunnel] --> Metabase
